er of doses allowed per county was capped at the population size of the county\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Coverage by race and ethnicity was not calculated because information on race and ethnicity was missing for 40% of data\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The percentage of persons who traveled outside their county of residence for vaccination was calculated at the national level and stratified by jurisdiction\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}